    <h3 id="field-fluid">
        Fluid Field
    </h3>
    <p>
        Form control elements (such as${" "}
        <span class="highlight">
            select
        </span>
        ${" "}and${" "}
        <span class="highlight">
            input
        </span>
        ${" "}) are inline-block by default, and will only use up as much of
        their parent's horizontal space as they need.
    </p>
    <p>
        For a stacked field the control must be set to 100% width (using the${" "}
