        </span>
        ${" "}helper class. Notice that each field is also set to fluid, in
        order to fill all available flexbox space (flexbox layout takes care of
        dividing the space evenly between fluid fields).
    </p>

    <p>
        If we set the form control width to 100% in an${" "}
        <em>unstacked</em>
        ${" "}field, the control would flow to a new line${" "}
