    </div>
    <div class="section-notice__main">
      <h3 class="section-notice__title">
        Note on Chips in Containers
      </h3>
      <p>
        Chips have a display of
        <code>inline-flex</code>
        so they will naturally inherit some native inline attributes. One
        of those is the implied white space between each one. Bear this mind
        when creating your container.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p>
