<div id="calendar">
  <section-header/>

  <h3 id="calendar-readonly">
    Readonly Calendar
  </h3>
  <p>A readonly calendar has cells containing static text or hypertext.</p>
  <p>
    The current date is conveyed using
    <code>calendar__cell--current</code>
    and clipped text.
  </p>

