  <p>
    <strong>NOTE:</strong>
    for the eagle-eyed BEM afionados, we are saying each span has an
    <em>implicit</em>
    class of
    <code>calendar__cell</code>
    .
  </p>

  <h3 id="calendar-readonly-inactive">
