  <h3 id="panel-dialog-sliding">
    Sliding Panel
  </h3>
  <p>
    Panels can slide in and out, using the
    <code>dialog__window--slide</code>
    modifier.
  </p>
  <p>
    The slide transition duration is 32ms. An accompanying
    <code>dialog--mask-fade-slow</code>
    modifier on the
    <code>panel-dialog</code>
    should also be applied. This slower fade matches the 32ms of the slide
    transition.
  </p>

