  <p>
    By default, the position of the overlay and its pointer will remain static.
    For these following examples, we are using
    <a target="_blank" href="https://floating-ui.com">
      floating-ui
    </a>
    to help position the tooltip and the pointer dynamically.
  </p>
  <p>
    In order to get this to work with floating-ui, you need to remove pointer
    position
    <code>infotip__pointer--top-left</code>
    and remove any style positioning
  </p>

  <div class="demo">
