  <h3>List Layout</h3>

  <p>
    List layout should be used when it's desired to have wider horizontal
    buttons. These are more easily stackable on narrower screens.
  </p>

  <p>
    You may use this layout by adding the
    <code>toggle-button-group--list-layout</code>
    modifier to the toggle button group.
  </p>

