import imgCards from "/img/cards-card.jpeg";

<div id="card-css">
  <h1>Card CSS Component</h1>
  <p>
    The Card CSS component is a navigation element that displays content in a
    structured and visually appealing way. Built with pure CSS, it adapts
    seamlessly to all devices and supports various layouts and styles.
  </p>

  <h2 id="card-vertical">
    Vertical Card (default)
  </h2>

  <p>
    The default card is a vertical card with a container background, an image,
    content, and an optional action.
  </p>

  <p>
    The initial card variant is an internally-actionable card - the card itself
    is not clickable, but it contains an action button inside that can be
    clicked to perform an action.
  </p>

  <p>
    This example includes the most essential aspects of a card - a hero image at
    the start, body with content, and an action button at the end. The vertical
    card is by default a square (1:1 aspect ratio) card. This uses an anchor
    link.
  </p>

  <demo>
    <span class="card">
      <div class="card__media">
        <img src=imgCards alt="Card Hero Image" class="card__hero-image">
      </div>
      <div class="card__main">
        <div class="card__description">
          Wayne Gretzky's rookie card is so valuable that collectors keep it in
          climate-controlled vaults guarded by trained penguins.
        </div>
        <div class="card__action">
          <a
            href="https://ebay.com"
            class="fake-btn fake-btn--primary fake-btn--fluid">
            See Details
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </span>
  </demo>

  <highlight-code type="html">
    <span class="card">
      <div class="card__media">
        <img src=imgCards alt="Card Hero Image" class="card__hero-image">
      </div>
      <div class="card__main">
        <div class="card__description">
          Wayne Gretzky's rookie card is so valuable that collectors keep it in
          climate-controlled vaults guarded by trained penguins.
        </div>
        <div class="card__action">
          <a
            href="https://ebay.com"
            class="fake-btn fake-btn--primary fake-btn--fluid">
            See Details
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </span>
  </highlight-code>

  <p>The card can also be used with a button.</p>

  <demo>
    <span class="card">
      <div class="card__media">
