  <h2 id="disabled-card">
    Disabled Card
  </h2>

  <p>
    Cards that are disabled will appear grayed out and unclickable. The specific
    implementation depends on the card type.
  </p>

  <h3 id="disabled-internally-actionable-card">
    Disabled Internally-Actionable Card
  </h3>

  <p>
    For internally-actionable cards, the button inside will need to be disabled.
    The outer card does not look or need to look disabled since it's not itself
    an interactive element. The button will visually indicate its disabled state
    by setting the button to
    <code>disabled</code>
    .
  </p>

  <demo>
    <span class="card card--aspect-16-9">
      <div class="card__media">
        <img src=imgCards alt="Card Hero Image" class="card__hero-image">
