          stored in temperature-controlled cellars and discussed in hushed,
          reverent tones.
        </div>
        <div class="card__action">
          <button class="btn btn--primary btn--fluid" disabled>
            See Details
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </span>
  </demo>

  <highlight-code type="html">
