  <h3 id="pagination-overflow">
    Overflow Rules for Pagination
  </h3>
  <p>
    A leading and/or trailing overflow element may occupy a slot in the
    pagination if the total number of pages is greater than seven.
  </p>
  <p>
    This overflow element can be a static icon (see below) or an interactive
    menu button (see next section).
  </p>

